From ce6040ab73235b8672d307fca931df0fbf47b4aa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 15:44:21 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(i18n): add Spanish (ES) as third language, convert
 all hardcoded ternaries to t() calls
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Add ES translations to STRINGS in i18n.js (~460 keys across FR/EN/ES)
- Add 85+ new translation keys for previously hardcoded UI strings
- Update detectDefaultLang() to support ES (localStorage → browser lang → fallback)
- Update toggleLang to cycle through fr/en/es
- Add ES to internationalTopicTitles.json (26 topic display names)
- Add ES to social-copy.js (SOCIAL_COPY messenger strings)
- Add ES to AsyncChallenge.js (COPY object for async duel mode)
- Add ES to identity.js (IDENTITIES display names and taglines)
- Convert all fr ? ternaries to t() calls in 12 component files:
  SkipLink, HomeLoading, PlaySheet, FeedScreen, feed, screens,
  ProfileContent, MatchHistory, CommunityComposer, ui, players
- Update language toggle from binary FR/EN to 3-language selector
